	"Description": "Nightly activity digest. Surveys the last 24 hours in parallel -- ingest volume per tag against a weekly baseline, notable activity in the data, what alerts and automation did, and platform health including Gravwell's own logs -- then writes a short Markdown message telling the operator what needs attention and what to investigate today, with validated starting queries. Automated and read-only; intended to run on a nightly schedule.",
